n your favourite athletes and teams in the UK and around the world.\n\nThe Athletic app has every major league covered by award-winning talent. Our newsroom of 400+ full-time staff delivers in-depth coverage of hundreds of professional and college teams across more than 47 North American markets and all 20 football clubs in the English Premier League, as well as many Championship clubs.\n\nSeamlessly access the latest scores, stats, breaking news, long-form features and audio offerings all in one place. Download The Athletic today to stay up to date on your daily sports news.  \n\nThe Athletic Features:\n\nEXCLUSIVE SPORTS NEWS, INSIGHTS, AND ANALYSIS\n- Go deeper with in-depth, global coverage and exclusive sports news.\n- Our award-winning newsroom of more than 400 sports journalists. \n- Get exclusive access to expert insights and analysis. \n- Explore deeply-reported long reads and exclusive sports interviews.\n\nSPORTS SCORES AND STATS ON ALL MAJOR TEAMS AND LEAGUES\n- Discover the top sports stories of the day, breaking news and live score updates, all from the biggest names in sports writing.\n- Access exclusive coverage on professional and college teams across NFL, hockey, basketball, football and beyond,\n- Find sports news updates for the United States and international sports. \n- Follow your favourites so you never miss sports scores or stats.\n\nUNMATCHED SPORTS NEWS, STORIES, AND PODCASTS:\n- Follow and listen to a variety of sports podcasts on your favourite leagues\n- Discover daily podcasts like “The Athletic FC”, “The Totally Football Show” and “The Race F1 Podcast”.\n\nCONNECTIONS: SPORTS EDITION\n- Play The Athletic’s daily game for sports fans. \n- Group sports terms that share a common thread.\n\nSTAY UP TO DATE ON YOUR SPORTS:\n- EPL\n- IPL\n- LTA\n- Formula 1\n- ECB\n- NBA\n- PGA Golf\n- Premier League\n- FIFA Club World Cup\n- Motorsports\n- and more\n\nTerms of Service: https://help.nytimes.com/hc/en-us/articles/115014893428-Terms-of-Servic